        "subject": "Preparation Guide — Your SSD Studio Session",
        "html": "<h1>Getting Ready for Your Session</h1><p>Hi {{$node[\"Webhook: Booking Created\"].json.body.clientName}},</p><p>Your session is in 48 hours! Here's everything you need to know:</p><ul><li><strong>What to wear:</strong> Choose comfortable clothes that reflect your style.</li><li><strong>Where to park:</strong> Free parking available in Lot B.</li><li><strong>Arrival:</strong> Please arrive 10 minutes early.</li></ul>"
      },
      "id": "email-prep-guide",
      "name": "Send Preparation Guide",
