        "subject": "Final Timeline — See You Tomorrow!",
        "html": "<h1>Your Session is Tomorrow</h1><p>Hi {{$node[\"Webhook: Booking Created\"].json.body.clientName}},</p><p>Here's your exact timeline, parking instructions, and studio access details for tomorrow's session.</p><p><strong>Time:</strong> {{$node[\"Webhook: Booking Created\"].json.body.startTime}}</p>"
