        "html": "<h1>Your session is in 2 hours!</h1><p>Hi {{$node[\"Webhook: Booking Created\"].json.body.clientName}},</p><p>We're excited to see you soon! Don't forget:</p><ul><li>Parking: Lot B (free)</li><li>Studio access code will be texted 30 minutes before</li></ul>"
